abraflexi-tui (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Czech and German UI translations with an in-app Language menu
    (GNU gettext).
  * Add a record Download dialog: pick an export format from AbraFlexi's
    format catalog and a destination path.
  * Add horizontal scrolling to the record list when more columns are
    selected than fit the window width.
  * Add CUPS printing support for documents and attachments.
  * Add a QR code view for the status-line URL and a document preview
    dialog.
  * Add a relation picker dialog and schema-aware rendering of
    date/datetime/relation record fields.
  * Add an Arkanoid/Breakout mini-game under the Help menu.
  * Bind each window to its own company and show it in the title bar.
  * Build against the system libtvision-dev package via pkg-config
    instead of the vendored tvision submodule.

 -- Vitex Software <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:35:28 +0200

abraflexi-tui (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Turbo Vision (tvision) TUI frontend for abraflexi-cli.
  * Status, company list and evidence browser screens.
  * Generic, evidence-parameterized record list, detail view and
    record creation (JSON payload editor with mandatory-field hints,
    dry-run and force support).

 -- Vitex Software <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:54:45 +0200
